        "fontSize": "17px"
       },
       "tabletStyles": {},
       "children": [],
       "innerHTML": "This website uses <strong>Google Analytics</strong> (which pages people visit and how they got there) and <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> (heatmaps and recordings of clicks and scrolling). They collect your IP address, device and browser details, and how you use the pages. The site shows no ads, and Google's advertising features are never turned on."
      },
      {
       "attributes": {},
       "baseStyles": {
        "color": "var(--on-muted)",
        "fontSize": "19px",
        "lineHeight": "1.6",
        "margin": "0",
        "maxWidth": "680px"
       },
       "blockId": "f3af17cb30",
       "classes": [],
       "element": "p",
       "mobileStyles": {
        "fontSize": "17px"
       },
       "tabletStyles": {},
       "children": [],
       "innerHTML": "<ul><li><strong>Who is asked.</strong> On your first visit, your browser asks ipapi.co to estimate your country from your IP address. If you're in the EU or California, or the estimate fails, you're asked before analytics run. Everywhere else, analytics are on by default and no banner appears.</li><li><strong>Before you answer, or if you refuse</strong>, Google Analytics runs with cookies denied: it sends cookieless pings without identifiers. Clarity doesn't load at all.</li><li><strong>Your choice</strong> is stored in your browser, not on a server. Clearing this site's data resets it.</li></ul>"
      },
