       "tabletStyles": {},
       "children": [],
       "innerHTML": "I don't sell or rent anyone's data. These services process it for me, each under its own privacy policy: Supabase (the sync service), Google (sign-in, if you choose it, and analytics), Microsoft (Clarity), ipapi.co (the country estimate), and the company that hosts this website."
